---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import LanguageToggle from "@/components/LanguageToggle.astro";
import BackToTopButton from "@/components/BackToTopButton.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | SecurityOn Research Journey">
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="app-layout py-8 sm:py-12">

    <!-- =========================================================
         Header
    ========================================================== -->
    <section class="border-border border-b pb-10">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm text-skin-base/60">
            journey.securityon.org/about
          </p>

          <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
            About
          </h1>

          <p
            data-lang="ko"
            class="ko-body mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-skin-base/75"
          >
            IT와 보안 분야에서 쌓아온 실무 경험을 바탕으로
            AI Security를 공부하고 연구하는 과정을 기록하고 있습니다.
          </p>

          <p
            data-lang="en"
            class="mt-4 hidden max-w-2xl leading-7 text-skin-base/75"
          >
            I document my continuing journey from professional practice
            in IT and security towards graduate study and research in AI Security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <LanguageToggle />
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =========================================================
         Profile
    ========================================================== -->
    <section class="border-border border-b py-10">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">
        Profile
      </p>

      <h2
        data-lang="ko"
        class="ko-ui mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold"
      >
        반석 · BAN Seok
      </h2>

      <h2
        data-lang="en"
        class="mt-3 hidden text-2xl font-semibold"
      >
        BAN Seok · 반석
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-skin-base/60">
        IT & Security Engineer · M.S. Student
      </p>

      <p
        data-lang="ko"
        class="ko-body mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-skin-base/80"
      >
        인터넷 서비스, 네트워크 인프라, 정보보안, 클라우드 및 SRE 분야에서
        실무 경험을 쌓아왔습니다. 현재 삼성SDS에서 Network SRE 업무를
        수행하고 있으며, 국립공주대학교 테크노융합대학원 IT융합
        석사과정에서 AI와 보안의 접점을 공부하고 있습니다.
        실무에서 접한 문제를 연구 가능한 질문으로 발전시키고,
        배우고 실험하고 실패하고 수정하는 과정을 이곳에 기록하고자 합니다.
      </p>

      <p
        data-lang="en"
        class="mt-5 hidden max-w-3xl leading-7 text-skin-base/80"
      >
        My professional experience spans Internet services, network
        infrastructure, information security, cloud computing, and SRE.
        I currently work in Network SRE at Samsung SDS while pursuing
        an M.S. in IT Convergence at Kongju National University.
        My goal is to transform problems encountered in real enterprise
        environments into researchable questions at the intersection of
        artificial intelligence and security, while documenting the process
        of learning, experimentation, failure, and revision.
      </p>


      <!-- Public / Professional Profiles -->
      <div
        class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm text-skin-base/60"
      >
        <a
          href="https://github.com/securityon"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:text-accent"
        >
          GitHub
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/securityon/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:text-accent"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>

        <a
          href="mailto:security@securityon.org"
          class="hover:text-accent"
        >
          Email
        </a>

        <span class="text-skin-base/30">·</span>

        <a
          href="https://search.naver.com/search.naver?where=nexearch&sm=tab_etc&mra=bjky&x_csa=%7B%22fromUi%22%3A%22kb%22%7D&pkid=1&os=32229285&qvt=0&query=%EB%B0%98%EC%84%9D"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:text-accent"
        >
          <span data-lang="ko" class="ko-ui">
            네이버 인물정보
          </span>

          <span data-lang="en" class="hidden">
            Naver People Profile
